r to configure that time in the office's local timezone.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-8\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-4\",\n    \"Q-2\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The configured office timezone differs from the test client's timezone and the test clock is near a date boundary\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"the response date values match the configured office-local date boundaries\",\n     \"when\": \"the system evaluates today's date and the scheduling window\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A report job is scheduled near the start of Monday in the office timezone\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.2\",\n     \"level\": \"job\",\n     \"then\": \"the job event records a Monday-morning run according to the configured office-local time\",\n     \"when\": \"the job scheduler evaluates its run time\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Folio3 parking web app shall evaluate today, the 30-day scheduling window, daily release cutoffs, and weekly report scheduling using the configured office-local timezone.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-9\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-2\",\n    \"I-3\",\n    \"I-4\",\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"Q-2\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A future release or a same-day release before the configured daily release time is scheduled\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-10.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"the availability response includes the released space\",\n     \"when\": \"the office-local clock reaches the daily release time\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A dedicated holder releases today's space after the configured daily release time\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-10.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"the response indicates that the space is available immediately\",\n     \"when\": \"the release request completes\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a scheduled release reaches the daily release time or a sa